// from the L2J H5 datapack, table docs/plan/positional_skills.md): behindOnly = Backstab (L2J handler: never lands from the FRONT),
// behindBonus = blows (Mortal / Deadly / Lethal / Critical / Blinding Blow, Shining Edge: land chance x1.5 side, x2 behind), turnsTarget =
// Bluff (the target takes my heading = turns its back to me), stepsBehind = Shadow Step (lands 25 behind the target). L2J zones: front =
// within 60 deg of the target's facing, behind = within 60 deg of its back, side = between.
