//  - behind (or within 2.5 s after my Bluff / Shadow Step) -> cast normally;
//  - the target fights a TEAMMATE (or nobody / another player) -> step to the spot ~60 behind it (collision radius + 30, 50..90): behind, then
//    behind +-40 deg, then the sides; never a spot inside a NEW aggressive monster's aggro circle, never a spot where a step already got stuck
//    (a wall: I did not move); one short straight move, re-checked every <= 1 s while it moves; after 3 s give up for 12 s (side = cast
//    everything, front = everything but Backstab);
//  - the target fights ME (solo, or it chose me): it turns with me, walking is wasted -> Bluff first (turns it) when known + ready, else
//    Shadow Step (behind it), else no Backstab and the blows from the front;
//  - raids / instances / hunting pairs (noMove): no stepping (the raid formation already puts melee behind the boss): only the Backstab filter.
// Each decision is logged once per monster + kind (Logs/positional.log): 'positional: stepping behind Grave Robber for Backstab'.
