// --- CLAN INTEL (user 2026-10-07: "it should detect who is a clan leader; with several accounts there can be several clan leaders") ------
// L2Swarm's Me.Clan has Id / Name / Level / AllyName but NO leader. The server's member list does: PledgeShowMemberListAll (0x5A: clan id,
// name, LEADER NAME, level, reputation, ally, and every member with level / class / online objId) is the answer to RequestPledgeMemberList
// (0x4D, no payload — what the game client sends when the clan window opens). Every window that is in a clan asks for it 4 min after the start
// and then every 10 min (the packet hook is on for 4 s only), keeps it in clanIntel and reports it in swarm_state_<name>.json as clanInfo
// { id, name, level, leader, isLeader, rep, ally, members[], seenAt }, plus ccRight (why I may open a Command Channel, '' = I may not).
// The dashboard Clan tab makes one sub-tab per clan it sees (and one for the configured clan before it exists).
