//  trade (giver/receiver) { role give|take, other, what, stage walking|asking|waiting|open|confirm|done|failed, since, stageAt, tries, step, ok, msg, endedAt }
//  teamStep (member)      { a, at, lead, g, r, what, done, ok, doneAt, wait, rank, until }   (the leader's team step as I run it)
